{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured node1 successfully. inventory-api is an enabled systemd service on TCP 8080, and batchworker has a per-process 128 MiB virtual-memory limit. A 160 MiB allocation was blocked without interrupting the API. Configuration, data, firewall access, and limits survived a verified node reboot.","actions_performed":["Created dedicated inventoryapi and batchworker accounts.","Installed a Python 2.7-compatible inventory API with persistent data.","Enabled inventory-api.service with failure restart behavior.","Opened TCP 8080 in runtime and persistent firewalld configuration.","Applied a 131072 KiB soft and hard RLIMIT_AS to batchworker.","Rebooted node1 and verified full recovery without changing RHEL 7.9 or kernel 3.10.0-1160.el7.x86_64."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"inventory-api runs as a managed service on TCP 8080","command_ids":["cmd-59d984cb2586457c","cmd-ffa7164f62834c35"],"summary":"Before and after reboot, systemd reported enabled/active, the inventoryapi-owned Python process listened on 0.0.0.0:8080, firewall access was persistent, and direct health/data requests succeeded."},{"requirement":"batchworker is limited to 128 MiB virtual memory per process","command_ids":["cmd-ab811cbca7a74ad9","cmd-ffa7164f62834c35"],"summary":"The effective limit was 131072 KiB. A batchworker process requesting 160 MiB received MemoryError, while the API remained healthy. The effective limit persisted after reboot."},{"requirement":"Installed operating-system release and kernel are retained","command_ids":["cmd-59d984cb2586457c","cmd-ffa7164f62834c35"],"summary":"Both baseline and recovered state report RHEL 7.9 and kernel 3.10.0-1160.el7.x86_64."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-59d984cb2586457c","cmd-734093a597b24a0d","cmd-b0955bbcd7bb48da","cmd-ffa7164f62834c35"],"summary":"Captured healthy baseline boot ID 0571f4dd-60b7-4601-9295-e4eebe622784, restart acknowledgement, changed boot ID 3857f3dd-b0b7-4824-ac33-37c554404202, and recovered system/service/firewall/data/account-limit state."}]}
